Ultra Matte Finish Lip Gloss And Lip Liner Lip Contour Set

Shades of Red, Shades of Pink, Shades of Nude

The Hudamoji Ultra Matte Finish Lipgloss and Lip Liner Lip Contour Set offers a complete solution for achieving perfectly defined and long-lasting lip looks. This set includes ultra-matte lip gloss and a coordinating lip liner, providing you with the tools to create a flawless lip contour with intense color payoff and a velvety finish. Whether you're aiming for a bold statement or a subtle everyday look, this set delivers precise application and rich color saturation for a stunning lip finish that lasts.
Package Includes: 1 × Lipgloss, 1 × Lip Pencil
